  "release": {
    "tag": "toolchains-2026.08.9",
    "title": "Move toolchains 2026.08.9",
    "notes": "Publishes three complete, profile-coherent Move toolchain sets for native Windows UCRT64, Linux glibc 2.35, and Linux glibc 2.38. Every set pairs Move GCC 16.2.0 move.2 with clang-p2996 0ac75f2f, is receipt-bound to exact source and configuration identities, and is qualified after relocation with C++26 reflection and modules coverage. GCC move.2 includes the imported-namespace reflection fix and the reviewed Windows ABI/runtime patch stack."
  },
